+# Version Scheme
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to use semantic versioning (semver, MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH) for version numbers, because it communicates the nature and impact of each change (breaking changes, features, patches) more clearly to consumers deciding whether an upgrade is safe.
